OL,3,GNEWSAMan given indefinite hospital
OL,4,Aorder after killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been sentenced to an
OL,7,Findefinite hospital order after he
OL,8,Fadmitted killing another man.
OL,10,FGraham Janes, of Peartree Drive in
OL,11,FChard, Somerset, was sentenced at
OL,12,FBristol Crown Court after he admitted
OL,13,Fmanslaughter by diminished
OL,14,Fresponsibility and actual bodily harm.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
