OL,3,GNEWSAMan given indefinite hospital
OL,4,Aorder after killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 50-year-old fatally attacked Colin
OL,7,FLawson who took him into his home in
OL,8,FMare Lane, South Petherton, on 22
OL,9,FAugust 2025, while Janes was
OL,10,Fexperiencing mental health
OL,11,Fdifficulties. Janes was initially
OL,12,Fcharged with murder but psychiatrists
OL,13,Fagreed his state of mind had
OL,14,Fsubstantially contributed to his
OL,15,Factions.
OL,17,FDet Con Stephanie Craig, from Avon and
OL,18,FSomerset Police, said the case had been
OL,19,F"extremely sad and distressing".
